  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.header": "How 2 use teh Item Sink",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_1": "Unwanted stuff goes in, moneyz comes out! One thingy per work cycle.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_2": "Right-click teh machine. Put accepted stuff in teh input slot on teh left.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_3": "Only configured stuff wif available moneyz outputs can go in. Check Item Sink Conversion recipes in JEI.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_4": "By default, machine needs Forge Energy (FE) from generator or battery. Any side takes power. Energy bar iz on teh left.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_5": "Machine glows while working! Progress arrow fills while using FE. Stuff's value tier decides time and FE cost.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_6": "Get ur moneyz from teh two output slots on teh right. Each finished cycle eats one input thingy.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_7": "Default moneyz iz Create: Numismatics coins. No Numismatics? Set outputItem to installed stuff like minecraft:emerald in item_sink-common.toml.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.header": "Make teh Item Sink do it itself",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_1": "Use a hopper to feed accepted stuff. Dis chest an' hopper fill teh input from above.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_2": "Another hopper puts moneyz in a chest. It only grabs teh two output slots, so unprocessed stuff stays inside.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_3": "Keep teh FE coming! Stuff in, moneyz out an' FE in all work on every side.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_4": "Machine takes a nap if next payment won't fit or FE runs out. Clear teh output an' give it power.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_5": "Room for moneyz + enough FE = machine wakes up an' works again!",
